{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-ethics-governance","title":"AI伦理与治理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/ai-applications/ai-ethics-governance","wordCount":3216,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"ai伦理与治理\">AI伦理与治理</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>随着人工智能深入社会生活的方方面面——从招聘筛选到刑事量刑，从医疗诊断到金融信贷——一个不可回避的问题浮出水面：我们如何确保 AI 系统是公平的、透明的、对人类有益的？AI 伦理与治理不是技术发展的附属品，而是与技术进步同等重要的核心议题。算法偏见可能加剧社会不平等，黑箱模型可能侵蚀公众信任，数据滥用可能侵犯个人隐私。理解这些风险并掌握应对方法，是每一个 AI 从业者的必修课。</p>\n<p>本节涵盖以下核心知识点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>算法偏见与公平性</li>\n<li>可解释 AI（XAI）</li>\n<li>隐私保护技术（联邦学习 / 差分隐私）</li>\n<li>AI 法规与政策（欧盟 AI 法案等）</li>\n<li>自主武器伦理</li>\n<li>负责任 AI 开发框架</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"算法偏见与公平性\">算法偏见与公平性</h3><p>**算法偏见（Algorithmic Bias）**指 AI 系统在对不同人群的处理中表现出系统性的不公平。偏见可以来源于数据、算法设计或部署环境。</p>\n<p>偏见的来源：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>训练数据偏差</td>\n<td>数据不代表真实群体分布</td>\n<td>人脸识别数据集中深肤色样本不足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史偏见</td>\n<td>数据反映了历史上的歧视性决策</td>\n<td>招聘数据偏向男性（因历史上男性录用率更高）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标签偏见</td>\n<td>标注者的主观判断引入偏见</td>\n<td>情感分析中对特定方言的负面评价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表示偏差</td>\n<td>特征设计隐含假设</td>\n<td>使用邮编作为特征间接引入种族信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评估偏差</td>\n<td>评估指标不适合所有群体</td>\n<td>总体准确率高但少数群体错误率很高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>公平性的数学定义</strong>并非唯一，不同的定义之间甚至存在内在矛盾：</p>\n<p><strong>群体公平性（Demographic Parity）</strong>：预测为正的比例在各群体中相同：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\hat{Y}=1 | A=0) = P(\\hat{Y}=1 | A=1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是敏感属性（如性别、种族）。</p>\n<p><strong>机会均等（Equalized Odds）</strong>：真正例率和假正例率在各群体中相同：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\hat{Y}=1 | Y=1, A=0) = P(\\hat{Y}=1 | Y=1, A=1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>个体公平性（Individual Fairness）</strong>：相似的个体应该得到相似的预测结果。</p>\n<p>2016 年 ProPublica 的调查揭示了 COMPAS 累犯风险评估工具的种族偏见——黑人被告被错误归为高风险的概率是白人的两倍。这个案例成为了算法公平性研究的标志性事件。</p>\n<p><strong>缓解策略</strong>包括三类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>预处理</strong>：在训练前对数据进行去偏（如重采样、数据增强）</li>\n<li><strong>训练中</strong>：在损失函数中加入公平性约束</li>\n<li><strong>后处理</strong>：调整模型输出的阈值使各群体达到目标公平性指标</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"可解释-ai-xai\">可解释 AI（XAI）</h3><p>深度学习模型虽然表现出色，但通常是<strong>黑箱</strong>——我们知道它给出了什么答案，却不知道为什么。在医疗、金融和法律等高风险领域，模型的可解释性至关重要。</p>\n<p>**可解释 AI（eXplainable AI, XAI）**旨在让 AI 的决策过程对人类可理解。</p>\n<p>可解释性方法的分类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>范围</td>\n<td>全局解释</td>\n<td>理解模型整体行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>局部解释</td>\n<td>解释单个预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型依赖性</td>\n<td>模型无关</td>\n<td>适用于任何模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>模型特定</td>\n<td>利用模型内部结构</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>LIME（Local Interpretable Model-agnostic Explanations）</strong>：通过在预测点附近生成扰动样本，用一个简单的可解释模型（如线性回归）来局部近似原始模型的行为。例如，对于一张被分类为&quot;猫&quot;的图片，LIME 可以高亮出对分类贡献最大的图像区域。</p>\n<p><strong>SHAP（SHapley Additive exPlanations）</strong>：基于博弈论中的 Shapley 值，为每个特征分配一个&quot;贡献分数&quot;，表示它对最终预测的贡献。SHAP 值满足效率性、对称性和虚拟性等理论公理，提供了理论上最优的特征归因。</p>\n<p>对于特征 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的 Shapley 值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>∖</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_i = \\sum_{S \\subseteq N \\setminus \\{i\\}} \\frac{|S|!(|N|-|S|-1)!}{|N|!} [f(S \\cup \\{i\\}) - f(S)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.943em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">⊆</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∖</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)!</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是所有特征集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是不包含特征 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的子集，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是只使用特征子集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 时的模型预测。</p>\n<p><strong>注意力可视化</strong>：对于 Transformer 类模型，可以通过可视化注意力权重来理解模型&quot;关注&quot;了输入的哪些部分。但需要注意，注意力权重不一定等同于特征重要性——高注意力权重不一定意味着高因果贡献。</p>\n<h3 id=\"隐私保护技术\">隐私保护技术</h3><p>AI 模型通常需要大量数据来训练，但数据中往往包含个人敏感信息。如何在保护隐私的前提下进行 AI 训练？</p>\n<p><strong>联邦学习（Federated Learning）</strong>：Google 于 2016 年提出的分布式学习框架。核心思想是&quot;数据不动模型动&quot;——各参与方在本地数据上训练模型，只上传模型更新（梯度或参数），中央服务器聚合这些更新来改进全局模型。</p>\n<p>联邦学习流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>服务器将全局模型分发给各参与方</li>\n<li>各参与方在本地数据上训练，计算模型更新</li>\n<li>参与方将更新上传至服务器</li>\n<li>服务器聚合更新（如 FedAvg：简单平均）</li>\n<li>重复直到收敛</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[中央服务器] --&gt;|分发模型| B[设备A]&#10;    A --&gt;|分发模型| C[设备B]&#10;    A --&gt;|分发模型| D[设备C]&#10;    B --&gt;|上传梯度| A&#10;    C --&gt;|上传梯度| A&#10;    D --&gt;|上传梯度| A\">graph TD\n    A[中央服务器] --&gt;|分发模型| B[设备A]\n    A --&gt;|分发模型| C[设备B]\n    A --&gt;|分发模型| D[设备C]\n    B --&gt;|上传梯度| A\n    C --&gt;|上传梯度| A\n    D --&gt;|上传梯度| A</pre><p>联邦学习的挑战包括：数据异质性（各方数据分布不同）、通信效率（频繁传输模型参数）和安全性（梯度可能泄露部分训练数据信息）。</p>\n<p><strong>差分隐私（Differential Privacy, DP）</strong>：Dwork 等人提出的隐私保护的数学框架。一个算法满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\epsilon, \\delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>-差分隐私，如果增删一条记录对输出分布的影响很小：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>ϵ</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P[\\mathcal{M}(D) \\in S] \\leq e^\\epsilon \\cdot P[\\mathcal{M}(D&#x27;) \\in S] + \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只差一条记录，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 是隐私预算（越小隐私保护越强），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是失败概率。</p>\n<p>在深度学习中，**DP-SGD（Differentially Private SGD）**通过对梯度裁剪并加入校准的高斯噪声来实现差分隐私：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>g</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>clip</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{g}_t = \\frac{1}{B}\\left(\\sum_{i \\in B} \\text{clip}(g_i, C) + \\mathcal{N}(0, \\sigma^2 C^2 I)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">clip</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>差分隐私提供了形式化的隐私保证，但代价是模型精度的下降——这是隐私与效用之间的基本权衡。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ai-法规与政策\">AI 法规与政策</h3><p>全球范围内，AI 治理的立法进程正在加速。</p>\n<p><strong>欧盟 AI 法案（EU AI Act, 2024）</strong>：全球首部全面的 AI 监管法规，采用<strong>基于风险的分级方法</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险等级</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>要求</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不可接受风险</td>\n<td>对基本权利构成威胁</td>\n<td>全面禁止</td>\n<td>社会信用评分、实时远程生物识别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高风险</td>\n<td>影响重大权益</td>\n<td>严格合规要求</td>\n<td>招聘 AI、信贷评估、医疗 AI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有限风险</td>\n<td>需要透明度</td>\n<td>披露义务</td>\n<td>聊天机器人、深度伪造</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小风险</td>\n<td>日常应用</td>\n<td>无强制要求</td>\n<td>垃圾邮件过滤、游戏 AI</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>高风险 AI 系统必须满足：技术文档、数据治理、人类监督、准确性/鲁棒性/安全性要求、事件报告等。违规罚款最高可达全球营业额的 7% 或 3500 万欧元。</p>\n<p><strong>中国的 AI 治理</strong>：采取&quot;分领域、渐进式&quot;的监管路径，已出台《生成式人工智能服务管理暂行办法》（2023）、《互联网信息服务深度合成管理规定》等多项法规。</p>\n<p><strong>美国的 AI 治理</strong>：以行政命令和自愿承诺为主，2023 年拜登政府发布了关于安全、可靠和可信赖 AI 的行政命令。</p>\n<h3 id=\"自主武器伦理\">自主武器伦理</h3><p><strong>致命性自主武器系统（LAWS）</strong>——能够在无人干预下选择和攻击目标的武器——是 AI 伦理中最具争议的议题之一。</p>\n<p>支持限制的观点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>机器不应拥有生杀决定权，这违反了人的尊严</li>\n<li>算法错误在战场上可能造成灾难性后果</li>\n<li>可能降低发动战争的门槛</li>\n<li>责任归属不明确——如果 AI 武器误杀平民，谁来负责？</li>\n</ul>\n<p>反对限制的观点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>AI 可以比人类更精确地区分战斗员和平民</li>\n<li>自主系统可以减少己方伤亡</li>\n<li>军事技术竞争不可避免</li>\n</ul>\n<p>联合国层面的讨论自 2014 年以来一直在进行，但至今未能达成具有约束力的国际条约。国际人工智能军备控制仍然是一个开放而紧迫的问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"负责任-ai-开发框架\">负责任 AI 开发框架</h3><p>多家机构和企业提出了负责任 AI 开发的原则框架：</p>\n<p><strong>Google AI 原则</strong>（2018）：7 条原则 + 4 条禁区，强调社会有益性、避免偏见、安全性、对人的问责等。</p>\n<p><strong>OECD AI 原则</strong>（2019）：被 42 个国家采纳，包括包容性增长、人本价值与公平、透明与可解释、鲁棒性与安全性、问责制等五大原则。</p>\n<p><strong>负责任 AI 的实践框架</strong>通常包括：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>影响评估</strong>：在项目启动前评估潜在的社会影响和风险</li>\n<li><strong>数据审查</strong>：检查训练数据的代表性、偏见和隐私问题</li>\n<li><strong>模型审计</strong>：定期测试模型在不同群体上的表现差异</li>\n<li><strong>人类监督</strong>：在高风险场景下保留人类最终决策权</li>\n<li><strong>持续监控</strong>：部署后持续监控模型行为，及时发现漂移和偏见</li>\n<li><strong>文档化</strong>：记录模型的设计决策、训练数据、已知限制和预期使用场景</li>\n</ol>\n<p>**模型卡片（Model Cards）<strong>和</strong>数据集声明（Datasheets for Datasets）**是 Google 和微软等公司推广的标准化文档实践，旨在提高 AI 系统的透明度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>偏见检测实验</strong>：使用 AI Fairness 360（IBM 开源工具包）或 Fairlearn（Microsoft），在一个二分类数据集（如 Adult Income 数据集）上训练模型，检测模型在性别和种族维度上的公平性指标差异。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>可解释性实践</strong>：使用 SHAP 库对一个训练好的 XGBoost 或随机森林模型进行特征重要性分析。生成 SHAP 摘要图（summary plot），讨论最重要的特征是否符合你的领域直觉。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>隐私预算思考</strong>：差分隐私中，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon = 0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon = 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 分别意味着什么？如果你要为一个医疗 AI 系统选择隐私预算，你会如何权衡隐私保护程度和模型准确率？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>法规分析</strong>：查阅欧盟 AI 法案的正式文本，判断以下系统分别属于哪个风险等级：(a) 简历自动筛选系统；(b) 视频平台的推荐算法；(c) 自动驾驶汽车的行人检测系统；(d) 智能音箱的语音助手。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>伦理困境</strong>：一辆自动驾驶汽车面临不可避免的事故——直行会撞到行人，转弯会使乘客面临危险。算法应该如何决策？这个&quot;电车难题&quot;的 AI 版本有标准答案吗？不同文化背景下的偏好可能有何不同？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>公平性综述</strong>：Mehrabi et al., &quot;A Survey on Bias and Fairness in Machine Learning&quot;（ACM Computing Surveys, 2021），系统梳理了 AI 公平性的定义、来源和缓解方法。</li>\n<li><strong>可解释 AI</strong>：Christoph Molnar,《Interpretable Machine Learning》（<a href=\"https://christophm.github.io/interpretable-ml-book/），免费在线的\">https://christophm.github.io/interpretable-ml-book/），免费在线的</a> XAI 入门教材。</li>\n<li><strong>联邦学习</strong>：McMahan et al., &quot;Communication-Efficient Learning of Deep Networks from Decentralized Data&quot;（AISTATS 2017），联邦学习的奠基论文。</li>\n<li><strong>欧盟 AI 法案</strong>：完整文本可在 EUR-Lex（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/）上查阅，是\">https://eur-lex.europa.eu/）上查阅，是</a> AI 从业者理解监管环境的必读材料。</li>\n<li><strong>AI 伦理入门</strong>：Kate Crawford,《Atlas of AI》，从政治经济学视角审视 AI 产业链的社会影响，视角独特。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>AI 伦理与治理涵盖了从技术到政策、从个体到社会的多个层面。算法偏见提醒我们，数据和模型可能放大而非消除社会不公平；可解释 AI 为黑箱模型打开一扇理解的窗口；联邦学习和差分隐私在保护隐私的前提下释放数据价值；AI 法规正在全球范围内从原则走向立法；自主武器伦理则触及了 AI 应用的底线。作为未来的 AI 从业者，技术能力和伦理意识同样重要——我们不仅要知道 AI 能做什么，更要思考 AI 应该做什么、不应该做什么。负责任的 AI 开发不是对创新的束缚，而是让 AI 技术可持续发展、真正造福人类的必要前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AI伦理与治理","id":"ai伦理与治理"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"算法偏见与公平性","id":"算法偏见与公平性"},{"level":3,"text":"可解释 AI（XAI）","id":"可解释-ai-xai"},{"level":3,"text":"隐私保护技术","id":"隐私保护技术"},{"level":3,"text":"AI 法规与政策","id":"ai-法规与政策"},{"level":3,"text":"自主武器伦理","id":"自主武器伦理"},{"level":3,"text":"负责任 AI 开发框架","id":"负责任-ai-开发框架"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"强化学习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/ai-applications/reinforcement-learning"},"next":null}